# Lab 02 - Autumn Holiday Week: SSPR + PIM (New!)

**Date:** Oct 2024 - Holiday Week
**Lab:** Microsoft Entra self-service password reset

This is my main work from this video - full lab completed.

## Video Proof
Working video: Shows Lenovo laptop, Entra admin center, My Account, PIM.

## Tasks Completed

### 1. Exploring Entra ID & My Account
- Screen: My Account - MOD Administrator
- Explored Privileged Identity Management > My Roles
- Checked Security Agents & Entra ID Overview

### 2. Managed Privileged Roles via PIM
- Screen: User administrator | Assignments
- Action: + Add assignments
- Settings:
    - Assignment type: **Eligible** (Best practice - requires activation)
    - Role: User Administrator
    - Members: Added test user

### 3. Tested SSPR Flow
- Screen: Reset password - Success
- Result: Your password has been reset successfully
- SSPR policy enforced, user can self-serve without helpdesk

## Why This Matters
- Implements Zero Trust - Just-In-Time, Just-Enough access
- Reduces helpdesk tickets by enabling self-service
- Key skill for SC-900 & IT Support roles

